# UI / Design System

Direction: **"Instrument"** — hardware laboratory + performance-car configurator. Graphite ground, hairline rules, mono spec readouts, one signal accent. **Not** neon gamer kitsch, not glassmorphism.

## Palette

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Background / ink | `#0C0D0F` |
| Surface | `#141619` |
| Elevated | `#1C1F23` |
| Foreground / cream | `#EEF0F2` |
| Muted | `#A3A9B1` |
| Subtle | `#6E747C` |
| Border / border-strong | `#23262B` / `#3A3F45` |
| Accent (signal orange) | `#FF6B2C` — **sparingly**: primary CTA, eyebrows, warnings |
| Pass | `#7FD9A8` — compatibility pass only |

## Typography

- Display: Archivo, expanded (`[font-stretch:112–125%]`), bold/extra-bold
- Body: Instrument Sans
- Technical / labels: JetBrains Mono (`.label-mono`, `.eyebrow`)

## Patterns

- Hairline grid: `gap-px bg-border` parent, `bg-background` cells (`productGridClass`).
- Photos sit on `.media-bed`; hero / gallery / builder stage add `.crop-marks`.
- Section headers: `SectionHeader` with `index` + `eyebrow` → `01 / CONFIGURATOR`.
- Buttons: `Button` variants `default` (accent), `solid` (white), `outline`, `ghost`; pill radius, ≥44px targets.

## Avoid

Blur, glow, gradient text/washes, color orbs, left-border callout cards, emoji icons, unlayered global CSS that sets colors.

## Layout notes

- Homepage = one continuous story; content max width 1360px, 40px gutters desktop / 16px mobile.
- Builder desktop: left slot rail | center photo + options | right server-priced summary. Mobile: progress segments + step pills.
- Product tiles: photo, brand · type, stock, name, key spec, price, actions.

